      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "וירדפו אל מדין",
      "rationale": "Go ka bolela gape 'ba latela ba Midiane' (setšhaba, e sego lefelo), eupša go latelela go ya go bopelelo bja Midiane ke tlhahlo ya tlwaelo."
    }
